--- Test 2: REVISE with supersedes succeeds + emits superseded fact ---
  p1.id                                          "proposition_2"
  p2.id                                          "proposition_3"
  ids differ?  YES (correct — REVISE creates a new element)
  superseded(A,B)                                [{"A":"proposition_3","B":"proposition_2"}]
